{"4022080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Discovery Of Magic", "steam_appid": 4022080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vulcan College, the school for spell weavers and seekers has officially opened its doors to you young wizard in training! Learn the arcane arts and become a master weaver in this free-to-play, VR multiplayer spellslinging adventure. To master the ways of magic and ascend the ranks of this prestigious college, you’ll need to have your wits about you. Craft powerful combinations of spells and best your classmates in high stakes duels to establish yourself among the greatest wizards of our time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to Weave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting spells in Discovery of Magic is no simple press of a button. You’ll have to learn the ways of the Pattern and weave magical threads in the air with your wand to summon the elements or manifest powerful beasts to fight by your side. <strong>The more precise your weave, the more powerful your spells will be</strong>. In our world your physical mastery is as important as your strategic mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/fca6bae9308e349b98c4e1560167d9b0.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/fca6bae9308e349b98c4e1560167d9b0.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/fca6bae9308e349b98c4e1560167d9b0.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spells, spells and some more spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>hundreds of different spells</strong>, each with their own applications and effects. Call a dragon to burn your opponent or ward yourself with a magic shield to deflect a projectile. Combine them into a unique spell deck of your own design and unlock powerful new synergies and combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/0da9f22ad49cdbf97dcb186eae131500.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/0da9f22ad49cdbf97dcb186eae131500.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/0da9f22ad49cdbf97dcb186eae131500.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Halls of Vulcan College</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join one of the three prestigious houses of Vulcan College; Solaria, Luna or Terra. Mingle with your fellow house mates in social hubs, discover the lore of the college, or go get some peace and quiet in your own customisable private quarters. Unlock custom designs, wands and costumes as you progress through the ranks in school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duels &amp; Tournaments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills in simultaneous, turn-based duels. Join with friends to fight in teams of up to 4 players or go solo against other players or AI. Fight for your own glory to define your rank or build decks that compliment your teammates to overwhelm your opponents. Compete for the honor of your house in school wide competitions and tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Have What it Takes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enroll at Vulcan College now, master the ways of the Pattern, and claim your place among the greatest wizards of our time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vulcan College, the school for spell weavers and seekers has officially opened its doors to you young wizard in training! Learn the arcane arts and become a master weaver in this free-to-play, VR multiplayer spellslinging adventure. To master the ways of magic and ascend the ranks of this prestigious college, you’ll need to have your wits about you. Craft powerful combinations of spells and best your classmates in high stakes duels to establish yourself among the greatest wizards of our time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/1364497d716c9b62e873444399dc873d.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn to Weave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casting spells in Discovery of Magic is no simple press of a button. You’ll have to learn the ways of the Pattern and weave magical threads in the air with your wand to summon the elements or manifest powerful beasts to fight by your side. <strong>The more precise your weave, the more powerful your spells will be</strong>. In our world your physical mastery is as important as your strategic mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka