s you progress through the ranks in school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/b1e73e77780fe215ca53a7d4872d5775.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duels &amp; Tournaments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills in simultaneous, turn-based duels. Join with friends to fight in teams of up to 4 players or go solo against other players or AI. Fight for your own glory to define your rank or build decks that compliment your teammates to overwhelm your opponents. Compete for the honor of your house in school wide competitions and tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.poster.avif?t=1783154556\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.webm?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022080/extras/d439f911c610eae3a929a869adfd5b93.mp4?t=1783154556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Have What it Takes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enroll at Vulcan College now, master the ways of 